# SYNTAX TEST "text.html.tiddlywiki5" "A filtered transclusion closes on its styled suffix"

# filteredtranscludeinline.js and filteredtranscludeblock.js close on `}}`, an optional style, then
# `}` — `\}\}([^\}]*)\}` — so `}}}` is only the closer carrying an empty style. A reader who writes
# the style sees the transclusion end where TiddlyWiki ends it, and the prose after it reads as prose.

